english_text:
#EOTC #BREKAING

The Holy Synod Plenary Assembly passed the following decision in its meeting held today:

1. His Holiness Abune Dioscorus as the General Secretary of the Holy Synod;
2. His Holiness Abune Sawiros as the General Manager of the Office of the Patriarchate of the Holy See;
3. His Holiness Abune Hriakos as the Archbishop of the Addis Ababa A/Church;
4. His Holiness Abune Nathaniel as the Archbishop of the Holy Land Jerusalem Monasteries;
5. His Holiness Abune Nathaniel as the Archbishop of the Colorado A/Church;
6. His Holiness Abune Henok as the Archbishop of the South African A/Church;
7. His Holiness Abune Habakkuk to lead the Department of Monasteries as the Archbishop;
8. His Holiness Abune Moses has decided to lead the St. Gabriel and Mary Monastery of Gebi as the Archbishop, as he has taken possession of Australia.

The information was obtained from the Public Relations Department of the Ethiopian Orthodox Tewahedo Church.

